<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#142238"><meta name="description" content="A Sherubtse College community board for reporting and recovering lost and found items.">
  <title>Sherubtse Lost &amp; Found</title><link rel="icon" href="/Sherubtse_logo/images.jpg"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><script src="/js/app.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>
  <main>
    <section class="hero"><div class="hero-inner"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> Sherubtse College · Kanglung</span><h1>Lost something?<br><em>Let’s bring it back.</em></h1><p>A trusted campus space to report lost belongings, share items you have found, and help our community reconnect.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-gold" href="/report-lost">Report an item <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button button-outline" href="/browse">Browse listings</a></div><p class="hero-note">Please avoid posting passwords, private ID numbers, or other sensitive details.</p></div><div class="hero-mark"><div class="crest-frame"><img src="/Sherubtse_logo/images.jpg" alt="Sherubtse College crest"></div><div class="hero-mark-label"><span class="signal"></span> A campus community board</div></div></div></section>
    <section class="stats-strip" aria-label="Current listing totals"><div class="stats-inner"><div><strong id="stat-lost">&mdash;</strong><span>Open lost reports</span></div><div><strong id="stat-found">&mdash;</strong><span>Found items</span></div><div><strong id="stat-returned">&mdash;</strong><span>Marked returned</span></div><p>Every report helps someone take the next step.</p></div></section>
    <section class="section-pad"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">Recently reported</span><h2>New on campus</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/browse">See all listings <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div id="recent-items" class="item-grid compact-grid" aria-live="polite"><div class="empty-state">Loading recent listings…</div></div></section>
    <section class="how-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">Simple and community-led</span><h2>How it works</h2></div></div><div class="steps-grid"><article class="step-card"><span class="step-number">01</span><h3>Post a clear report</h3><p>Add the item name, where and when it was lost or found, and a few identifying details.</p></article><article class="step-card"><span class="step-number">02</span><h3>Check the listings</h3><p>Browse current reports and contact the poster using the details they chose to share.</p></article><article class="step-card"><span class="step-number">03</span><h3>Close the loop</h3><p>When the item is returned, mark your post as returned or remove it from the board.</p></article></div></section>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
